---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Aegis Egress • Outbound Zero-Trust & Sovereign AI | Aegis"
  description="Outbound security shield powered by local sovereign AI (< 50 ms) to neutralize data exfiltration, ransomware C2 callbacks, and phishing."
  lang="en"
>
  <main class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Hero Section Module 2 -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6 pt-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span>🦅 AEGIS EGRESS • OUTBOUND ZERO-TRUST &amp; SOVEREIGN AI</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Neutralize ransomware at the root and stop sensitive data from leaving your company.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        The first outbound network shield governed by <strong>100% sovereign local AI (&lt; 50 ms)</strong> that prevents exfiltration, phishing, and criminal C2 channels — <strong>without heavy workstation agents and with zero token costs (0 €/token).</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
        <a href="/get-started/" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-cyan-500 text-slate-950 font-bold text-sm shadow-lg">
          🧪 Run Passive Exfiltration Test (Free)
        </a>
        <a href="#systemone-specs" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold text-sm border border-slate-700">
          📚 System One Spec (/v1/systemone)
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Metaphor & Comparison Table -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 backdrop-blur-xl space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-mono">💡 THE HUMAN-ERROR RESILIENCE FILTER</h2>
        <blockquote class="text-slate-200 text-base italic border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-4 py-1">
          Picture a busy employee clicking on a weaponized email link: ransomware immediately tries to contact its command &amp; control server to fetch an encryption key. <strong>Aegis Egress acts as a strict border checkpoint at the company network exit</strong>. Before the payload can execute, Aegis AI evaluates the target domain and drops the connection in <strong>under 50 milliseconds</strong>.
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <!-- Comparative Table -->
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs font-mono">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400">
              <th class="p-4">Cyber Risk / Business Impact</th>
              <th class="p-4">Legacy Solutions (Workstation AV / Cloud Proxies)</th>
              <th class="p-4">With Aegis Egress (Edge Sovereign AI)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-800/60">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-white">Phishing Click / Ransomware Stager</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-400">Local antivirus reacts after malware has already spawned and run.</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-emerald-400 font-bold">Proactive source block: C2 callback terminated before any payload download.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-white">Privacy &amp; Regulatory Compliance (GDPR)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-rose-400">Proprietary cloud proxies decrypt and inspect private employee traffic.</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-cyan-400 font-bold">Strict Zero-Log: Exclusive inspection of network metadata (TLS SNI, FQDN entropy).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-white">AI Inference Cost ("SaaS Per-Seat Tax")</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-rose-400">Recurring token billing or 15€ to 30€/seat/month licensing fees.</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-emerald-400 font-bold">0 € per token (Token-Free): Open-source Nimble 9B SLM running locally on Ollama.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Architecture 2 Levels Diagram -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white text-center">⚙️ Two-Tier Interception Architecture</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-cyan-400 font-bold mb-2">LEVEL 1: CoreDNS + CrowdSec CTI Cache</div>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Resolves 85% to 90% of outbound queries in <strong>&lt; 2 ms</strong> by dropping known malicious domains and CERT threat feeds.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-emerald-500/40 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-2">LEVEL 2: System One Nimble 9B Engine</div>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Probabilistic vector evaluation via <strong>/v1/systemone</strong> in <strong>&lt; 50 ms</strong> (DGA detection, Shannon entropy, ASN heuristics) without metadata leaks.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tech Specs Snippet -->
    <div id="systemone-specs" class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 font-mono text-xs">
      <div class="text-slate-400 mb-3">// Sample /v1/systemone Request &amp; Typed Nimble 9B Verdict</div>
      <pre is:raw class="text-emerald-400 overflow-x-auto">
POST /v1/systemone HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:11434
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "nimble",
  "state": {
    "fqdn": "x99b-c2-beacon.random-domain.top",
    "domain_entropy": 4.85,
    "isCrowdSecMatch": false
  }
}

// HTTP/1.1 200 OK
{
  "action": "BLOCK",
  "confidence": 0.985,
  "threat_type": "C2_BEACON_DGA",
  "risk_score": 95,
  "engine": "SYSTEMONE_NIMBLE"
}
      </pre>
    </div>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <div class="text-center bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready to shut down ransomware without paying an AI SaaS tax?</h3>
      <a href="/get-started/" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-cyan-500 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-sm shadow-xl">
        🦅 Run my exfiltration diagnostic
      </a>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>
